description.description:
Home page body text (max 20,000 chars). Formatting is plain text with ONLY two features: indentation (leading spaces/tabs are preserved) and ALL CAPS (contiguous sequences of 2+ uppercase letters render blue and lightly bold; do NOT use **bold** asterisks). Each 
 is a line break and blank lines (

) simply stay blank lines (no <hr> dividers). Plain URLs, emails and [anchor](https://...) links are auto-linked; a PayPal, Venmo, Cash App, Stripe, Square, Google Pay or Zelle payment link on its own line becomes a Pay Now button; HTML is escaped. Images are NOT placed in text: give each page one header image with its `photo` field.
